# VNSHO — Singapore EV Mobility Intelligence

A comprehensive Singapore EV market intelligence dashboard with real-time LTA data, AI-powered chat assistant, carbon calculator, and email-gated access.

## Features

- **8-tab dashboard**: Home, Overview, Fleet by Type, Brand Rankings, EV Specs, Charging, Compare EVs, Calculator
- **Email-gated access**: Work email required (Gmail/Yahoo/Hotmail blocked), PIN verification
- **AI Chat Assistant**: Powered by Claude, with web search for live market intelligence
- **Carbon Calculator**: CO₂ footprint + petrol vs EV cost comparison
- **Compare EVs**: Apple-style side-by-side for 27 EV models
- **Latest LTA data**: M03 (May 2026), M09 (April 2026 fleet population)

## Deploy to Vercel (5 minutes)

### Step 1: Push to GitHub

1. Create a new repo at [github.com/new](https://github.com/new) — name it `vnsho-dashboard`
2. Upload all files from this folder to the repo (drag & drop works)

### Step 2: Deploy on Vercel

1. Go to [vercel.com](https://vercel.com) → Sign up with GitHub
2. Click **"Add New" → "Project"**
3. Import your `vnsho-dashboard` repo
4. Vercel auto-detects Vite — just click **"Deploy"**
5. Your site is live at `vnsho-dashboard.vercel.app` within 60 seconds

### Step 3: Add your API key (for AI chat)

1. In Vercel dashboard → your project → **Settings → Environment Variables**
2. Add: `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` = your key from [console.anthropic.com](https://console.anthropic.com)
3. Redeploy (Deployments → three dots → Redeploy)

### Step 4: Custom domain (optional)

1. In Vercel → Settings → Domains
2. Add `vnsho.com` or any domain you own
3. Update your DNS as instructed

