## Email Gate — Production Email Sending

The current build shows the PIN on-screen for demo purposes. To send real emails:

1. Sign up at [resend.com](https://resend.com) (free: 100 emails/day)
2. Create a new API route `api/send-pin.js`:

```javascript
export default async function handler(req, res) {
  const { email, pin } = req.body;
  await fetch('https://api.resend.com/emails', {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: {
      'Authorization': `Bearer ${process.env.RESEND_API_KEY}`,
      'Content-Type': 'application/json',
    },
    body: JSON.stringify({
      from: 'VNSHO <noreply@yourdomain.com>',
      to: email,
      subject: `Your VNSHO verification PIN: ${pin}`,
      html: `<h2>Your PIN is: ${pin}</h2><p>Enter this in the dashboard to access VNSHO EV Intelligence.</p>`,
    }),
  });
  res.status(200).json({ ok: true });
}
```

3. In `App.jsx`, replace the `setGateShowPin(true)` line with:
```javascript
await fetch('/api/send-pin', {
  method: 'POST',
  headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
  body: JSON.stringify({ email, pin }),
});
```

## Data Sources

- LTA M03: Car registrations by make (updated to May 2026)
- LTA M09: Vehicle population by fuel type (updated to April 2026)
- CDG ENGIE: ComfortDelGro press release (Sep 2025)
- Charging operators: Company disclosures and LTA tender data

